     "tag": "Spanish speaker alert",
     "title": "Lower, not \"go down\"",
     "paras": [
      "<i>Bajá</i> is <b>Lower</b> for a load. Not <i>go down</i>, not <i>down it</i>.",
      "<i>Subí</i> is <b>Hoist</b>. <i>Girá</i> is <b>Slew</b>. <i>Pará</i> is <b>Stop</b>.",
      "One word, loud and clear: the driver hears you over the engine noise."
     ],
     "avoid": "Go down! · Down it! · Turn it left!"
    },
    {
     "type": "choice",
